refused: d340_a_secret_where_a_plain_value_goes.cy:6:19, line 6 column 19
 6 |     let $p: u32 = $key;
   |                   ^^^^
 what: this is `u32.secret`, where `u32` is needed
 why:  a secret goes where a plain value is expected only through `.%reveal()`, inside a shield, so it can't be lost by accident (D340, D342)
